    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d760">

                <pb facs="0937" n="813" sameAs="frus:frus1921v01/pg813"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.7311c Al 5/49</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Cuba</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Long</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-04-08"><hi rendition="#italic">April 8,
                        1921</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received April 16.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 828</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to the Department’s
                    instruction No. 325, dated March 26, 1921,<anchor n="13" xml:id="d760-f1"/>
                    relative to the proposal for an agreement concerning the laying of certain
                    cables of All America Cables, Incorporated, and to the Legation’s despatch No.
                    822, dated April 5, <pb facs="0938" n="814" xml:id="pg814"/> 1921, enclosing
                    copies of its note No. 279 dated March 31, 1921,<anchor n="14" xml:id="d760-f2"
                    /> to the Foreign Office, I have the honor to transmit, herewith, copies of the
                    Foreign Office note (No. 476 April 5, 1921) in reply thereto, which accepts the
                    proposition as set forth in the Legation’s note No. 279. These copies have been
                    carefully compared with the original on file here, but the original will be
                    transmitted on request.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Boaz W. Long</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d760-a1.xml" xpointer="d760-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
